<title>ITALY: Fiat market share rises to 13 pct from 11.2.</title>
<headline>Fiat market share rises to 13 pct from 11.2.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian car group Fiat said its European market share rose in June to 13 percent from 11.2 percent in June 1996, industrial sources close to the group said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The sources said Fiat maintained its positions as the second largest car producer in Europe behind Volkswagen.</p>
<p>Its sales have been boosted in Italy by a government car incentive scheme introduced in January.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
